        "output": "1\n0\n4",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nExample case 1:\n\nFor the first query, S={5,6}S=\\{5, 6\\}S={5,6}, so the answer is ∣A5−A6∣=1|A_5-A_6|=1∣A5​−A6​∣=1.\nFor the second query, S={3,2,1,5}S=\\{3, 2, 1, 5\\}S={3,2,1,5} and we can see that ∣A3−A5∣=0|A_3-A_5|=0∣A3​−A5​∣=0.\nFor the third query, S={1,2,4}S=\\{1, 2, 4\\}S={1,2,4}."
      }
